{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103845","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103845/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103845/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103845/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103845","id":2905157501,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6N4vuR","number":103845,"title":"Fix stuck editor cameras and fix 3D error spam for non-finite transforms","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-03-09T02:48:25Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:37:24Z","closed_at":"2025-03-13T14:04:10Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103845","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103845","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103845.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103845.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-13T14:04:10Z"},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/80755 in a better way, fixes #96824, supersedes #102966.\r\n\r\nBefore https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/81076, in Godot 4.1 and earlier, Godot allowed INF/NAN in Range. This meant that it was possible to use INF/NAN for node transforms. The problem is that the editor code doesn't have any checks to handle this case. In both 2D and 3D, focusing a node at a non-finite position would break the editor camera. Additionally, in 3D, selecting a node with a non-finite transform would cause lots of errors to print to the console.\r\n\r\nAfter https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/81076, in Godot 4.2 to 4.4, Godot does not allow INF/NAN in Range. This meant that the user could not type INF/NAN to set a node to a non-finite transform. However, this broke the ability to use INF/NAN values elsewhere, and broke the display of existing INF/NAN values.\r\n\r\nMore importantly, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/81076 did not actually fix the underlying bug, so https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/80755 is actually not fixed yet. If you set a node to have a non-finite transform through means other than the editor inspector, such as editing a `.tscn` file or using a `@tool` script, then the same bug is still present in Godot 4.4-stable: you can break the editor camera and get error spam.\r\n\r\nIn PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100414 I proposed to allow Range to use INF/NAN again, but this would make the underlying bug https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/80755 easier to trigger, so I am making this PR which should be merged first.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds checks to the 2D and 3D editor code to skip non-finite transforms when focusing the editor camera, calculating bounding boxes, and positioning gizmos. This fixes the camera breaking and fixes the error spam in 3D.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103845/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103845/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}